{"page_content": "1. 会议概况\n澄湾智能会务与知识工程学术会议 CIKM-Teach 2027于2027年6月18日至20日在澄湾市云帆学术中心举办。主办单位为澄湾知识工程教学联盟（虚构）。主题为RAG、知识工程、智能会务、信息检索与隐私保护。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "01", "source": "01_CFP.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/01_CFP.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "完整征稿通知", "section": "会议概况", "paragraph_range": "5-6", "paragraph_start": 5, "paragraph_end": 6, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "c32193e652afa993b885332f24f34310b88c0eff6c4e14afe0befd681f6f2fea", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_id": "24baa1a89160fac52f907878e7f87408ff8c89c482bded60f2b8154370980430", "char_count": 114, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 114}}
{"page_content": "2. 投稿要求\n原创未发表研究，禁止一稿多投；全文中文或英文，6至8页PDF，文件不超过20MB；双盲评审，正文及PDF属性不得出现作者姓名、单位或致谢。通过教学模拟投稿系统提交，不接受邮件投稿。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "01", "source": "01_CFP.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/01_CFP.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "完整征稿通知", "section": "投稿要求", "paragraph_range": "7-8", "paragraph_start": 7, "paragraph_end": 8, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "c32193e652afa993b885332f24f34310b88c0eff6c4e14afe0befd681f6f2fea", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_id": "18becbf26f269e71d1f9fe37de38ba369d5c627334388f40c9aa8b0719cef510", "char_count": 98, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}}
{"page_content": "3. 重要日期\n摘要登记截止2027年3月10日18:00；全文投稿原截止2027年3月20日18:00，已由08更正通知明确替代为2027年3月27日18:00；录用通知4月20日；终稿5月10日18:00。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "01", "source": "01_CFP.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/01_CFP.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "完整征稿通知", "section": "重要日期", "paragraph_range": "9-10", "paragraph_start": 9, "paragraph_end": 10, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "c32193e652afa993b885332f24f34310b88c0eff6c4e14afe0befd681f6f2fea", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_id": "a58277de49182aa0697233b3d945ad9392a79d71eca066e29de601b77929a3ff", "char_count": 105, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 105}}
{"page_content": "4. 评审与发表\n每篇至少两份评审意见，关注创新性、方法可靠性和可复现性。仅提供教学模拟论文集，不承诺任何数据库检索或真实出版。每篇录用论文须至少一位作者完成作者注册并作报告。咨询：学术秘书岗 academic@cikm-teach.example.org（虚构）。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "01", "source": "01_CFP.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/01_CFP.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "完整征稿通知", "section": "评审与发表", "paragraph_range": "11-12", "paragraph_start": 11, "paragraph_end": 12, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "c32193e652afa993b885332f24f34310b88c0eff6c4e14afe0befd681f6f2fea", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 4, "chunk_id": "d827026e4e5dde306d40d9ef805bdc754dc62b2ea9a725d1f14aebe819adf8e1", "char_count": 133, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 133}}
