{"page_content": "1. 费用表\n币种人民币CNY，均按人计。普通作者早鸟1200元、常规1500元；学生作者早鸟800元、常规1000元；非作者听众早鸟500元、常规600元。早鸟以2027年5月1日23:59及之前到账为准，5月2日00:00起为常规。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "02", "source": "02_注册须知及费用.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/02_注册须知及费用.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "注册须知及费用", "section": "费用表", "paragraph_range": "5-6", "paragraph_start": 5, "paragraph_end": 6, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "f0fa6269b8d8dce69b0df8102573d539b853aea5622fad0ecbe68a7156b3ab23", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_id": "44f87313b5924dc96c36e81c31fe5453b477aac0055339579f1ce5b30796f1db", "char_count": 118, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 118}}
{"page_content": "2. 身份与权益\n学生作者须提供有效全日制学生证或在读证明。每份作者注册仅覆盖一篇论文；听众注册不能覆盖论文。费用含全部技术分会、会议资料、茶歇及6月18日至20日午餐；不含住宿、交通和晚餐。不同优惠不叠加。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "02", "source": "02_注册须知及费用.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/02_注册须知及费用.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "注册须知及费用", "section": "身份与权益", "paragraph_range": "7-8", "paragraph_start": 7, "paragraph_end": 8, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "f0fa6269b8d8dce69b0df8102573d539b853aea5622fad0ecbe68a7156b3ab23", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_id": "1e19a566c827b07faa99465e9b41feb0cf8cb7ab80567a0fef030459e50aab2d", "char_count": 104, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 104}}
{"page_content": "3. 办理流程\n录入注册身份和论文编号，上传资格证明，核对费用，按05付款政策办理，提交模拟凭证。注册截止2027年5月20日18:00。注册咨询为注册服务岗 registration@cikm-teach.example.org（虚构）。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "02", "source": "02_注册须知及费用.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/02_注册须知及费用.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "注册须知及费用", "section": "办理流程", "paragraph_range": "9-10", "paragraph_start": 9, "paragraph_end": 10, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "f0fa6269b8d8dce69b0df8102573d539b853aea5622fad0ecbe68a7156b3ab23", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_id": "0c9e407348afcc7a3c59627723b218c29d4b982824a106d695fe9a91ea915a35", "char_count": 120, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 120}}
