{"page_content": "1. 住宿\n推荐教学虚构云帆学舍，标间每间每晚300元，可住2人，含2份早餐；单间每间每晚260元，含1份早餐。入住6月17日、退房6月20日计3晚。自行预约付款，注册费不含住宿；房间余量未提供，不保证有房。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "03", "source": "03_住宿交通.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/03_住宿交通.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "住宿交通说明", "section": "住宿", "paragraph_range": "5-6", "paragraph_start": 5, "paragraph_end": 6, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "50d5aa591886867b1b6a1f97e03c6f8838999a230f865e341ae0ea7b5f280543", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_id": "791a8d7544de48d35118358674bfd9129d2f89dd59f81924bb61cc96f222e015", "char_count": 104, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 104}}
{"page_content": "2. 交通\n教学虚构澄湾东站至云帆学术中心：教学接驳车6月17日14:00、16:00两班，免费，约40分钟；须于6月10日18:00前在注册系统预约。会后接驳及机场线路未提供，需人工确认。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "03", "source": "03_住宿交通.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/03_住宿交通.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "住宿交通说明", "section": "交通", "paragraph_range": "7-8", "paragraph_start": 7, "paragraph_end": 8, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "50d5aa591886867b1b6a1f97e03c6f8838999a230f865e341ae0ea7b5f280543", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_id": "c42dafe93c2101cf628f3345476cecf562a7a2a6a44f96970165d9de36bf6837", "char_count": 95, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 95}}
{"page_content": "3. 会场位置\n云帆学术中心位于澄湾市学林路88号（虚构地址），云帆学舍步行至中心约10分钟。资料不提供真实地图定位。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "03", "source": "03_住宿交通.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/03_住宿交通.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "住宿交通说明", "section": "会场位置", "paragraph_range": "9-10", "paragraph_start": 9, "paragraph_end": 10, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "50d5aa591886867b1b6a1f97e03c6f8838999a230f865e341ae0ea7b5f280543", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_id": "5f44abecd4e5ca239d17ac0ba182dab8755a19eefb480baf94fce15fe6f2862d", "char_count": 59, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}}
