{"page_content": "1. 账号与新建\n教学模拟地址 https://submit.cikm-teach.example.org 为保留域名示例，不是真实可用服务。实验不需访问。模拟注册、验证邮箱、选择研究主题，录入标题、摘要、关键词及作者信息；作者信息仅在系统字段填写。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "04", "source": "04_投稿系统指南.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/04_投稿系统指南.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "投稿系统操作指南", "section": "账号与新建", "paragraph_range": "5-6", "paragraph_start": 5, "paragraph_end": 6, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "859f5b50f291b033dd10f1ec3924b06d67354e4c7e7634b4a642a7af6b78f745", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_id": "f084949f52ccf08f0224bcdcd46c681f6fd309adb4397990d51969314dca7d23", "char_count": 125, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 125}}
{"page_content": "2. 上传与提交\n上传匿名6至8页PDF，最大20MB。点击提交后出现状态Submitted和稿件编号才算成功；Draft不算成功。保存提交回执。摘要登记与全文提交是两个节点，截止见01及08。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "04", "source": "04_投稿系统指南.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/04_投稿系统指南.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "投稿系统操作指南", "section": "上传与提交", "paragraph_range": "7-8", "paragraph_start": 7, "paragraph_end": 8, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "859f5b50f291b033dd10f1ec3924b06d67354e4c7e7634b4a642a7af6b78f745", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_id": "400a2044a127752abbf5f8859e1733d8feb4bde40dee3fae253cdc0419579f47", "char_count": 97, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}}
{"page_content": "3. 修改与异常\n全文截止前可在同一编号下更新；截止后不能自行替换，需联系技术支持岗 support@cikm-teach.example.org（虚构）。上传失败先检查大小、格式、匿名属性、网络和回执；不得重复建稿。个人录用结果需授权系统查询，本知识库无结果数据。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "04", "source": "04_投稿系统指南.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/04_投稿系统指南.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "投稿系统操作指南", "section": "修改与异常", "paragraph_range": "9-10", "paragraph_start": 9, "paragraph_end": 10, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "859f5b50f291b033dd10f1ec3924b06d67354e4c7e7634b4a642a7af6b78f745", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_id": "6990f3f690d636595ea61f7a4a8d8abee12d8a9d645877eb7bbab13b35a0158e", "char_count": 133, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 133}}
