{"page_content": "1. 付款\n仅演示模拟对公转账流程，不提供真实收款账户、二维码或支付链接，不进行真实付款。模拟附言为注册编号加论文编号，听众填注册编号加LISTENER。以到账时间判定早鸟，上传凭证时间不等于到账时间。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "05", "source": "05_发票付款.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/05_发票付款.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "发票与付款政策", "section": "付款", "paragraph_range": "5-6", "paragraph_start": 5, "paragraph_end": 6, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "0a713a1a982fe920d3c464be2e3479ae95d334f0a59748931b194dfb3f2a0d09", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_id": "94184a2338c525eec77b4f1dd4b6154e8c7fe7d31cb8165e3c8a7289dc2e8bca", "char_count": 101, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 101}}
{"page_content": "2. 发票\n仅支持电子普通发票，项目为会议服务费。付款确认后5个工作日内发送至注册邮箱；单位抬头需名称及纳税识别号。发票仅含实际注册费，不含学舍住宿；住宿发票向学舍申请。不得据此确认个人付款已到账。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "05", "source": "05_发票付款.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/05_发票付款.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "发票与付款政策", "section": "发票", "paragraph_range": "7-8", "paragraph_start": 7, "paragraph_end": 8, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "0a713a1a982fe920d3c464be2e3479ae95d334f0a59748931b194dfb3f2a0d09", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_id": "979bb1330c898bb1e770bb4b8115c06523ece50e433d96eef5d22433e54745ac", "char_count": 99, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 99}}
{"page_content": "3. 退费\n2027年5月20日18:00及之前提交退费申请，扣已缴注册费10%手续费；之后不受理普通退费。已覆盖论文的作者须先确保有另一有效作者注册覆盖。所有申请须人工审核，到账时长未提供，不承诺必然批准。", "metadata": {"chunk_schema": "experiment1-v1", "doc_id": "05", "source": "05_发票付款.docx", "source_path": "data/raw/05_发票付款.docx", "format": "docx", "document_title": "发票与付款政策", "section": "退费", "paragraph_range": "9-10", "paragraph_start": 9, "paragraph_end": 10, "locator_type": "paragraph_range", "table_count": 0, "document_version": "current", "file_sha256": "0a713a1a982fe920d3c464be2e3479ae95d334f0a59748931b194dfb3f2a0d09", "start_index": 0, "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_id": "b236dadffafd6680c176cd4b86b6cfdf388882a27f86e105efeeaae3d281118b", "char_count": 104, "chunk_size": 600, "chunk_overlap": 100, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 104}}
